# The frozen FDA helper is the TCC identity of the LaunchAgent: the user's Full
# Disk Access grant is pinned to the cdhash of these exact bytes. Git must never
# run a clean/smudge filter, an EOL conversion, a diff driver or a merge driver
# over it — any of those would rewrite the file on checkout and silently revoke
# every user's grant (plan v2, M3f). See packaging/agent-src/PROVENANCE.md.
packaging/mp3-to-m4b-agent binary -filter -diff -merge -text
